OpenFastTrace (OFT) is a requirement management and tracing suite.

Requirement tracing keeps track of whether everything planned in the
specifications was actually implemented. It also identifies obsolete
parts of a product so they can be removed.

OFT imports specification items from Markdown, reStructuredText and
other formats, links them against tags in source code and tests, and
produces plain-text, HTML and other tracing reports.

Usage:
  oft trace /path/to/project
